WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.950
Ever wondered about the deepest desire of
SCP-073, the tragic and unharmable anomalous

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.589
human being known as Cain?

00:00:07.589 --> 00:00:11.980
Foundation researchers took a photo of Cain
while he ate lunch at the site cafeteria with

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:16.070
SCP-978, the Desire Camera, and here was the
result:

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.570
“Cain tending to an assorted range of plants
on a small farm.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:23.230
In the background, various domesticated animals
are wandering around.”

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:28.730
It’s another sad example of how sometimes,
our greatest desires lay forever beyond our

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:29.410
reach…

